  "id": "sensor",
  "term": "sensor",
  "definition": "A sensor is a monitoring point or device that captures input data, such as vibration signals, so the information can be analyzed or combined with data from other sensors. In learning systems, sensor data can be used to extract features and transfer what is learned from one monitoring point to another.",
